// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1221727393" "You captured a T.E.S.T. leader and escaped back into the tunnels to question him."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4053848198" "T.E.S.T. members are notorious for withstanding torture. Luckily for us <color yellow>Doctor Helix</color> has an assortment of chemicals we can put into his bloodstrem to make him amiable."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2744663694" "Helix's cocktail did the trick. Scott's been questioning our <i>guest</i> about the assassination, but so far the only information he's gotten is a name, and it's not good.<br><br>Eddie Polstra, a.k.a. <color red>Maelstrom</color>!<br><br>We've been trying to gather information on this guy for awhile now. He's a real mystery. He showed up out of the blue one day as Tyrant's new go-to-guy, but he totally dropped off the grid. Until now.<br><br>Scott wants us to get some solid information on him and capture him if we can. He says Arachnos is very displeased with what happened to their negotiation team and we've only got a little bit of time to get them some satisfactory answers."
// AcceptString :
"P3937668311" "Seek information about Maelstrom"
// SendOffString :
"P2086469230" "If T.E.S.T. is working with Maelstrom then they are bound to have some real data on the guy. The crap they've published about him is obviously fabricated lies.<br><br>I think it's time we stepped things up a bit. We're taking the fight straight into their teeth.<color orange>There's a T.E.S.T. training facility here in Neuron's Reach, and we're going to hit it.</color>"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1073599921" "Assault T.E.S.T. Facility"
// TaskTitle :
"P2604259315" "<color deepskyblue>Remember The Fallen</color>"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P3979520075" "<color deepskyblue>Part Three: Old Friends...</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1920330108" "The building outside is just a facade. You make your way through a few empty hallways and then breach a security door. You're inside, but they know you're coming."
// Script Variable HERO_ACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1327558872" "Alarm...!<em>I prefer a straight up fight anyway."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P819389779" "Raven team?!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P4191851514" "I won't stop until Duray is dead!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3826607081" "You have a choice, we didn't!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1085067631" "If Raven team is here, then Duray must be close."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2496752689" "<t=2 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=2><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor firebrick><b>WARNING!</b><t=2 caption x= 0.7 y=0.7 d=2><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor firebrick><b>WARNING!</b><t=2 caption x= 0.3 y=0.7 d=2><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor firebrick><b>INTRUDER ALERT!</b><t=2 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=2><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor firebrick><b>INTRUDER ALERT!</b><t=4 caption x= 0.5 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor firebrick><b>Security breach detected in sector seven!</b><t=5 caption x= 0.5 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor firebrick><b>All T.E.S.T. Rangers report to combat stations.</b><t=5 caption x= 0.5 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor firebrick><b>Repeat: All T.E.S.T. Rangers report to combat stations.</b><t=5 caption x= 0.5 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor firebrick><b>Civilian personnel please evacuate the facility in an orderly fashion.</b><t=3 caption x= 0.5 y=0.3 d=3><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor firebrick><b>This is not a test.</b><t=3 caption x= 0.5 y=0.3 d=3><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor firebrick><b>Repeat: This is not a test.</b>"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
