// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3824117897" "<shout>Target sighted... No!<em>It can't be!"
// Script Variable BOSS_75HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P2145886401" "Is that you, Crow?"
// Script Variable BOSS_50HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P2678637698" "Crow, you've got to stop!"
// Script Variable BOSS_25HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P1374025425" "Then you leave me no choice."
// Script Variable BOSS_DEAD_DIALOG :
"P3230298015" "Just... following... orders..."
