// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3846307538" "You hit the T.E.S.T. facility and gathered data on Maelstrom and Colonel Duray."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3697807819" "I've never heard of the 2nd Imperial Defense Force Regiment, but if both Duray and Maelstrom are stationed there then that is where we must go next. The path of vengeance is strange, {HeroName}. It will take you in directions you never anticipated, but always, always, it will take you to your destination."
// RandomFameString :
"P2304419156" "I heard that a Resistance attack on a T.E.S.T. facility was stopped cold. Man, those T.E.S.T. guys are tough."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1129517739" "We know where Maelstrom is really from. Scott has informed Arachnos of our findings and they were very interested in reopening talks. Apparently they are not on good terms with Ultimatum and an opportunity to take down one of their operatives is too good to pass up.<br><br>Arachnos has sent us two operatives, designated <color red>Blood Widows</color>. <color orange>We'll split into pairs and infiltrate Lambda Sector</color>."
// AcceptString :
"P554917216" "Infiltrate Lambda Sector"
// SendOffString :
"P1714191627" "I completely disagree with this, but Scott was adamant on this point. He wants us to pair off with the Blood Widows. Says it'll help smooth over relations if they end up having positive things to say about us to their leadership.<br><br>I'm sure they're equally annoyed with having to break their routine and pair off with us. Just make sure to watch them. Who knows what their orders really are.<br><br>I know the tunnels pretty well, so I'll take the low road while you gain access via one of the <color yellow>transport trucks</color> moving in and out of the place. "
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3760200857" "We've got a mission to do. Let's not keep our new teammates waiting."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P255033853" "<color deepskyblue>Part Four: ...New Friends...</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P953383505" "You exit the transport truck and make your way into one of the many side doors inside the compound. You briefly tense as you meet your Blood Widow partner for the first time, and then both of you relax your guard, slightly."
// Script Variable ChatMessage :
"P1787673480" "Alarm Activated"
// Script Variable HERO_NAME :
"P2989728729" "Blood Widow Scarlet"
// Script Variable HERO_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P690485269" "Nice outfit..."
// Script Variable HERO_ACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1745266067" "Let's find Maelstrom and be done with this."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1856524943" "We need to lower the defense screen for them.<em>And your friend, Crow. He should know that flirting with a blood widow is hazardous to his health."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1212750874" "Not that it bothers her, but your friend should really keep his eyes on the mission instead of on Dahlia's posterior.<em>Now let's deactivate those laser trip wires."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P14109778" "Cute. I can't believe she is falling for that guy."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P4128852356" "Great... See what your friend did?<em> Now the whole mission just went sideways."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P547376052" "<t=3 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=3><scale 1.75><color firebrick><bgcolor white> {HeroName}, it's Crow.<t=4 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color firebrick><bgcolor white>I don't know how to say this, but...<t=4 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color firebrick><bgcolor white>I think I'm in love with this woman.<t=4 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color firebrick><bgcolor white>Oh, we need the moat's motion sensors deactivated."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1918858523" "<t=4 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color firebrick><bgcolor white>Laser tripwires in ventillation duct E-4, can you deactivate those?<t=6 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color firebrick><bgcolor white>Anyway, she's everything I've ever looked for in a woman.<t=6 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color firebrick><bgcolor white>She's fit, she's smart, she's graceful, she likes sushi, did I mention fit?"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3146438807" "<t=5 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color firebrick><bgcolor white>I made her laugh. That's a good sign, right?"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1957574900" "<t=1 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=1><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor firebrick><b>WARNING!</b><t=1 caption x= 0.7 y=0.7 d=1><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor firebrick><b>WARNING!</b><t=1 caption x= 0.3 y=0.7 d=1><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor firebrick><b>INTRUDER ALERT!</b><t=1 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=1><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor firebrick><b>INTRUDER ALERT!</b><t=4 caption x= 0.5 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor firebrick><b>Security breach detected in sector seven!</b><t=5 caption x= 0.5 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor firebrick><b>All T.E.S.T. Rangers report to combat stations.</b><t=5 caption x= 0.5 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor firebrick><b>Repeat: All T.E.S.T. Rangers report to combat stations.</b><t=5 caption x= 0.5 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor firebrick><b>Civilian personnel please evacuate the facility in an orderly fashion.</b><t=3 caption x= 0.5 y=0.3 d=3><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor firebrick><b>This is not a test.</b><t=3 caption x= 0.5 y=0.3 d=3><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor firebrick><b>Repeat: This is not a test.</b><t=1 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=1><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor firebrick><b>WARNING!</b><t=1 caption x= 0.7 y=0.7 d=1><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor firebrick><b>WARNING!</b><t=1 caption x= 0.3 y=0.7 d=1><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor firebrick><b>INTRUDER ALERT!</b><t=1 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=1><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor firebrick><b>INTRUDER ALERT!</b><t=4 caption x= 0.5 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor firebrick><b>Security breach detected in sectory seven!</b><t=4 caption x= 0.5 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor firebrick><b>All T.E.S.T. Rangers to combat stations.</b>"
