// Dialog :
"P1649744311" "You and Blood Widow Scarlet deactivated the security measures to allow Blood Widow Dahlia and Crow to discover Maelstrom and Colonel Duray's current whereabouts."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2638206651" "That was a close call, {HeroName}. We barely managed to get through the ventillation system before they sealed it off.<br><br>I have to say though, it was worth it just to meet Dahlia. I've never met a woman quite like her. It sounds cheesy, but she's given me a reason to keep fighting after I've finished off Duray and avenged my brothers.<br><br>With the information we got from the main computer we know they're at Neuron Technologies Unlimited for some sort of demonstration."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission5 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P130377506" "Now's the chance to strike! With Maelstrom and Duray at the demonstration we can kill two birds with one stone... so to speak.<br><br><color orange>We're going to attack immediately.</color>"
// AcceptString :
"P2262019266" "Attack the Demonstration"
// SendOffString :
"P1795217864" "Dahlia and Scarlet are going to avenge their Arachnos comrades and move against Maelstrom. That leaves you and I to take out Colonel Duray."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P582359251" "Hunt down Colonel Duray"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1970046141" "Whenever you are ready."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P2025076677" "<color deepskyblue>Finale: ...Dead Friends.</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P981088863" "You and Crow enter the facility with the Blood Widows, Dahlia and Scarlet, and then split up, each in search of their target."
// Script Variable HERO_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1341542183" "We need to find Duray."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3903761698" "Scarlet isn't very friendly, is she?"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P478761053" "{HeroName}, Dahlia and Scarlet are in trouble!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P893286628" "{HeroName}... It's... It's my old unit!<em>Duray, what did you do to them!?"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P4054639200" "Damn you, Duray!<em>{HeroName}, we've got to help Dahlia!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1666377357" "<t=3 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=3><scale 1.75><color red><bgcolor black> {HeroName}, it's Scarlet.<t=6 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color red><bgcolor black> If Crow distracts my partner one more time I'll cut him... Deep.<t=6 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color red><bgcolor black> We're making our way through the maintenence tunnels, going radio silent."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3559819472" "<t=5 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color red><bgcolor black> {HeroName}, we've spotted Maelstrom, moving in..."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3147328331" "<t=5 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color red><bgcolor black>Damn, he's fast! Dahlia's hit!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P4172937575" "<t=3 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=3><scale 1.75><color red><bgcolor black>I got him... ufff!<t=3 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=3><scale 1.75><color red><bgcolor black>I... I'm hit..."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1764534716" "<t=3 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=3><scale 1.75><color red><bgcolor black>He... teleported... coward!<t=3 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=3><scale 1.75><color red><bgcolor black>We're headed... your way.<t=3 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=3><scale 1.75><color red><bgcolor black>Going... to need... a hand..."
