// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P2597913344" "Colonel Duray"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYINFO :
"P1990661595" "Colonel Duray is the military commander who is in charge of the 2nd Imperial Defense Force Regiment. In the past he subjected the entirety of Crow's company to Neuron's experimental T.E.S.T. P.L.U.S. procedure. Crow was the only survivor."
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3852639075" "<shout>Prepare my troops for combat, we have company!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3955563982" "You've been quite a thorn in my side.<em>Time to remove you."
// Script Variable BOSS_75HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P2401683125" "You can't win. The procedure benefited greatly from my men's sacrifices.<em>Allow me to show you."
// Script Variable BOSS_50HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P2595921174" "Imagine it, an entire army of these super soldiers!"
// Script Variable BOSS_25HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P4250479646" "This is just the beginning..."
// Script Variable BOSS_DEAD_DIALOG :
"P16228803" "Ah ha ha! You think death is the end?"
// Script Variable BOSS_KILLEDHERO_DIALOG :
"P1201036964" "<em victory>The weak have no place in war."
// Script Variable Greeting :
"P1127431811" "Hello, {HeroName}."

